WEBVTT

01:06:29.333 --> 01:06:30.601
this is not the same.

01:06:30.625 --> 01:06:35.059
I like that, I understand that people want
to borrow terminology from other areas

01:06:35.083 --> 01:06:37.268
so that they can create analogies,

01:06:37.292 --> 01:06:38.684
but it's trivial.

01:06:38.708 --> 01:06:42.768
It is something rather vulgar and boring
about the spouse work concept.

01:06:42.792 --> 01:06:45.893
It's like, it's a noninteresting
way of looking at it.

01:06:45.917 --> 01:06:47.184
What it says is this,

01:06:47.208 --> 01:06:49.309
the person with whom
you spend all the time,

01:06:49.333 --> 01:06:51.226
with whom you make all these decisions,

01:06:51.250 --> 01:06:53.393
with whom you share
so many important things.

01:06:53.417 --> 01:06:56.476
The only thing that is interesting
about the work spouse concept

01:06:56.500 --> 01:07:00.559
is that it betrays one reality
or it translates one reality,